Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Supplemental verification: 38 exact assertions", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"de753bef-0ab5-4357-89d6-d99f7eb5b849"],

Cell["\<\
Use a fresh Mathematica 12 kernel, then choose Evaluation > Evaluate \
Notebook. Keep this notebook in its supplied folder beside its .wl source. \
The final result must be True and COMPLETE AND PASSED: True.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9892deba-b734-46b4-86e2-cc598738f2c9"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook loads the original mathematical source through \
Notebook_Run_Helper.wl. TXT output, CSV checks and JSON summary are exported \
beside this notebook. NotebookAutoSave is enabled; press Ctrl+S after \
completion as well. Saved outputs from the author's recorded run are included. \
Evaluate the notebook to generate fresh results.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c3b75bb7-c997-416b-9df8-536ae586c6a2"],

Cell["\<\
Command-line Quit/Exit is handled by the notebook interface so that failures \
can be recorded and successful completion does not terminate the kernel. \
Mathematical formulas and assertions are unchanged. For full scope, see the \
program README.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92d1a000-8683-4b59-8bf3-994c9acdb053"],

